+
+    `prefer_side` IS THE DIRECTIONAL RULE ON AN OCO PAIR, AND IT DECIDES WHICH LEG, NEVER WHETHER.
+    `family_session_range_breakout` appends a LONG at the range high and a SHORT at the range low
